<span id="S3.T2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T2.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">What text do you see in this image?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T2.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T2.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">Detailed</th>
<td id="S3.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="S3.T2.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T2.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">This is an 8-letter English word where each half has been diagonally fused together. What word is it?</span>
</span></td></tr>
